  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_018 (0.713 accuracy) is the best so far with scvi_n200 RNA, resnet50 image, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l (a larger, more complex image encoder) while keeping the same RNA encoder, aggregation, and fusion method. The VIT encoder might improve performance, and this configuration hasn't been tested yet. Expected cost is ~6.5 GPU hours (similar to config_018), which is acceptable within the remaining budget. This balances exploration of image encoder impact with exploitation of proven components."  
}

